     3,
     61,
     9
    ],
    "text": "POSIX.1-2008, Technical Corrigendum 1, XSH/TC1-2008/0042 [146], XSH/TC1-2008/0043 [146], and XSH/TC1-2008/0044 [324] are\napplied.",
